* EQUATIONS "Source"
* 
EQUATIONS 5
Tsource = 13.08887 - 6.0924 * cos(0.0006635 * time*360/2/3.1416) - 3.9732 * sin(0.0006635*time*360/2/3.1416) + 1.1554 *cos(2*0.0006635*time*360/2/3.1416) + 0.6348 * sin(2*0.0006635*time*360/2/3.1416)
Tout = [167,1]
dVOut = [167,2]  / 1000  / 3600!kG/s
QSOURCE_IN = max(0, [167,5])
QSOURCE_OUT = min(0, [167,5])  
*$UNIT_NAME Source
*$LAYER Main
*$POSITION 420 55
*$UNIT_NUMBER 159

*------------------------------------------------------------------------------


* EQUATIONS "Parameters"
* 
EQUATIONS 15
TSurfAvg = 10.81
TSurfAmpl = 7.27
nDayMin = 22
TSurf = TSurfAvg + TSurfAmpl * sin (360/365*(time/24 - (nDayMin-270)))
SpHeatGround = 0.9074 !kJ/K.kg
DensityGround = 2688.95 ! kg/m3
ThCondGround = 7.002 ! kJ/hr.m.K
WriteStart = 0! 5année
Qcondrated = 15.5 * 3600 * 1000 ! [kJ/hr]
Qevaprated = 7.75 * 3600 * 1000 ! [kJ/hr]
r_in = 2.06 / 1.52
QChillerrated = 13 * 3600 * 1000 !MW to kj/hr
COPChillerrated = 6
THeatingLoop = 75 !°C
TCoolingLoop = 4 !°C
*$UNIT_NAME Parameters
*$LAYER Main
*$POSITION 1018 108
*$UNIT_NUMBER 168

